law.text:
		The Department shall administer this chapter and shall have the following powers and duties:

To establish the process for determining what areas qualify as housing revitalization zones. Such criteria shall be the minimum required for implementation of the purpose of this chapter;


To monitor the implementation and operation of this chapter;


To conduct a continuing evaluation program of housing revitalization zones;


To assist counties, cities and towns in obtaining the reduction of regulations within housing revitalization zones; and


To administer and enforce the regulations promulgated by the Board of Housing and Community Development.
